note the stack probe check on the scratch library lib: 0 when its wrappers hold exactly two probe loops, the first
note covering 2 pages (MOVZ X17, #2) and the second 5 (MOVZ X17, #5); 1 otherwise, 512 when unreadable
fn pchk lib view uchar * to ulong
if not sload lib
ret 512
end
if not wrange
ret 512
end
put g_n 16 0
put g_n 17 0
for i ulong div sub get g_n 15 get g_n 14 4 bound 9223372036854775807
pone add get g_n 14 mul i 4
end
if and eq get g_n 17 0 eq get g_n 16 2
