end
ret 1
end
note one word of the wrappers: a probe loop at o counts in g_n 16; a wrong MOVZ X17 before it sets g_n 17
fn pone o ulong to void
if not ploop o
ret
end
k = add get g_n 16 1
put g_n 16 k
if ne bw sub o 8 pwant k
put g_n 17 1
end
end
note the MOVZ X17 the k-th probe must hold: #2, then #5
fn pwant k ulong to ulong
